- Alfriend, K. T., Vadali, S. R., Gurfil, P., How, J. P., & Breger,
  L. S. (2010). *Spacecraft Formation Flying: Dynamics, Control and
  Navigation*. Butterworth-Heinemann.

**Numerical method**

- Hairer, E., Nørsett, S. P., & Wanner, G. (1993). *Solving Ordinary
  Differential Equations I: Nonstiff Problems*, 2nd ed. Springer.
  — classical RK4, and the truncation-error behaviour that motivates
  the tolerances chosen above.
